    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The ultimate choice of strategy: individual strength or military power</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fantasy simulation set in the Age of Exploration, in which masters who can summon and control monsters go on an adventure through the &quot;Book of Domination.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon monsters on a hex-divided map and lead your army to victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427170/extras/960d46465b638aad14f589593980bd22.avif?t=1750900697\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u201cQuantity\u201d and \u201cQuality\u201d collide</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you have weak monsters, by aligning their numbers, you can compete with monsters with overwhelming quality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command an army of monsters and fight against powerful enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427170/extras/9378f688d17b8f6cc72611d38c35201b.avif?t=1750900697\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique monsters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of monsters appear, including dragons with overwhelming power, fairies who can use healing magic, and werewolves who have the power to become your followers. Use different monsters depending on your strategy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427170/extras/27457c21e6a13d715c00240296db2c6b.avif?t=1750900697\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strengthen your monsters and prepare for strong enemies!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the experience points you earn in battle to increase your stats and learn new skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you further strengthen it, new monsters may be released! ?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427170/extras/230d31f08ba0a8d8d396718b54ed2321.avif?t=1750900697\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The ultimate choice of strategy: individual strength or military power</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fantasy simulation set in the Age of Exploration, in which masters who can summon and control monsters go on an adventure through the &quot;Book of Domination.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon monsters on a hex-divided map and lead your army to victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427170/extras/960d46465b638aad14f589593980bd22.avif?t=1750900697\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u201cQuantity\u201d and \u201cQuality\u201d collide</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you have weak monsters, by aligning their numbers, you can compete with monsters with overwhelming quality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command an army of monsters and fight against powerful enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427170/extras/9378f688d17b8f6cc72611d38c35201b.avif?t=1750900697\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique monsters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of monsters appear, including dragons with overwhelming power, fairies who can use healing magic, and werewolves who have the power to become your followers. Use different monsters depending on your strategy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427170/extras/27457c21e6a13d715c00240296db2c6b.avif?t=1750900697\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strengthen your monsters and prepare for strong enemies!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the experience points you earn in battle to increase your stats and learn new skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you further strengthen it, new monsters may be released! ?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427170/extras/230d31f08ba0a8d8d396718b54ed2321.avif?t=1750900697\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
